    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23549" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δαυλιάς</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>woman of Daulis,</i> epith. of
			Procne, who was changed into <i>the nightingale,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.29
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δαυλία κορώνη,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>); so her sister Philomela, changed into <i>the
			swallow,</i> was <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δαυλίς</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.727d
			</span></i>.</div>
